; ==========================================================================
; UNIVERSAL OXPLOW Z-OFFSET SEARCH - FIRST LAYER CALIBRATION
; ==========================================================================
; Firmware Flavor : STEALTHCHANGER
; Bed Dimensions  : 350 x 350 mm
; Material / Temp : ABS (Bed: 100C, Nozzle: 245C)
; Nozzle Diameter : 0.4 mm | Filament: 1.75 mm
; Tools Included  : [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
; Nominal Height  : 0.240 mm
; Ramp Span       : 0.140 mm (bottom) -> 0.340 mm (top) (+/-0.100 mm)
; Resolution      : 0.0040 mm (4.0 microns) per line (51 lines)
; ==========================================================================
; QUICK VISUAL INSPECTION GUIDE (HOW TO READ YOUR PRINT):
; 1. Inspect the printed patch under slanted lighting.
; 2. Locate the line with the smoothest, most uniform surface:
;    - Bottom lines (Y < Center): Nozzle too close / over-squish / rough ridges.
;    - PERFECT REGION           : Smooth, zero gaps, zero ridges, uniform sheen.
;    - Top lines (Y > Center)   : Nozzle too far / under-squish / separate round lines.
; 3. Measure distance or count tick marks relative to the Center Mark (0.00 mm):
;    - If best line is BELOW center: Nozzle was TOO HIGH -> Lower Z-offset (-).
;    - If best line is ABOVE center: Nozzle was TOO CLOSE -> Raise Z-offset (+).
;    - Offset Formula: Z_new = Z_current - (Z_best - Nominal_Height)
; ==========================================================================

; --- START G-CODE SEQUENCE ---
PRINT_START TOOL_TEMP=245 BED_TEMP=100 TOOL=0 MATERIAL=ABS T0_TEMP=245 T1_TEMP=245 T2_TEMP=245 T3_TEMP=245 T4_TEMP=245
M83 ; ensure relative extrusion
G90 ; ensure absolute positioning

